WEBVTT

00:01:38.070 --> 00:01:41.950
As I feared... Was that rumor true?

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.620
What rumor?

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.750
I heard Suou-san's father...

00:01:52.430 --> 00:01:54.820
died recently.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:09.700
Tan-tan... hasn't been home?

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:22.440
I didn't know. Tan-tan's father, of all people...

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:29.120
Tan-tan... where did you go?

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:32.750
We've arrived.

00:02:37.980 --> 00:02:42.300
It's unusual to see Shuurei-dono using a carriage.

00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:53.090
Here.

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:56.000
This is what you asked me for.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.720
Thank you very much, Ran-shogun.

00:02:59.180 --> 00:03:01.570
I'm honored to be of help.

00:03:01.860 --> 00:03:03.690
Here, have some dumplings.

00:03:03.690 --> 00:03:04.780
Thank you.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.950
Huh? These are...

00:03:10.140 --> 00:03:11.620
the same...

00:03:12.010 --> 00:03:15.010
They were delicious, so I ordered more.

00:03:15.010 --> 00:03:16.470
Thanks for the meal.

00:03:18.690 --> 00:03:20.520
Hold on.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:23.550
If you don't mind, would you eat it as is?

00:03:24.950 --> 00:03:26.280
Oh? Sure.

00:03:35.140 --> 00:03:40.640
I wonder why His Highness presented iris crests to Kouyuu and me.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:41.480
What?

00:03:41.910 --> 00:03:45.320
Was it because only Kouyuu and I were there at the time?

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:48.330
I don't think so.

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:56.250
I think that at the time, only Ran-shogun and Kouyuu-sama were worthy to receive irises.

00:03:57.140 --> 00:03:58.520
Why is that?

00:03:58.520 --> 00:04:02.720
You'll have to ask Ryuuki himself for the answer.

00:04:05.110 --> 00:04:06.250
That's true.

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:18.400
Mistress,

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:21.790
I have received an ornamental hairpin from the jeweler.

00:04:21.790 --> 00:04:24.910
Oh, it's the custom-made one, isn't it?

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:26.030
Please.

00:04:27.660 --> 00:04:30.120
What beautiful jade and pearls...

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.540
Put it on the shelf over there.

00:04:32.540 --> 00:04:33.320
Yes, mistress.

00:04:37.530 --> 00:04:41.500
Wow, it's full of expensive jewels.

00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:49.910
I'm glad you live and work here.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.680
My husband often isn't home at night.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:54.310
Umm, no problem.

00:04:54.310 --> 00:04:57.540
I don't know where he amuses himself,

00:04:57.540 --> 00:05:00.570
but I'm satisfied as long as I can be surrounded by beautiful objects.

00:05:00.570 --> 00:05:06.220
As long as he lets me have as many jewels,
clothes, and ornamental hairpins as I want,

00:05:06.220 --> 00:05:08.070
I'm content with that.

00:05:09.980 --> 00:05:13.830
Excuse me, but there's something not as beautiful here.

00:05:15.410 --> 00:05:18.850
What? How did that get here?

00:05:18.850 --> 00:05:21.930
My husband was doing something there, but I don't want that.

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:23.870
Throw it away right now.

00:05:24.580 --> 00:05:25.840
Yes, mistress.

00:05:26.330 --> 00:05:28.340
Seiga-san, it was in the report.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:33.720
The family that's been attempting to buy saltworks in Ranshuu...

00:05:34.410 --> 00:05:35.730
is the Chin family.

00:05:37.440 --> 00:05:42.450
More than half of the salt transport routes run through Chin family territory.

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:46.890
The Chin family wouldn't tamper with salt from Ranshuu,

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:50.240
perhaps because they planned to purchase saltworks there.

00:05:50.240 --> 00:05:54.440
Besides, it's risky to tamper with high grade salt from Ranshuu.

00:05:55.030 --> 00:05:57.740
Like Rin-san said, to make a profit on salt,

00:05:57.740 --> 00:06:04.130
it's best to skillfully adjust the price by adding white sand to low grade salt.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:08.070
Even if you're caught, all you have to do is pretend to be a victim.

00:06:08.070 --> 00:06:13.410
I've researched the Chin family's residence in Kiyou.

00:06:14.010 --> 00:06:20.150
I've heard that the mistress has been spending a lot more on clothes and accessories lately.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:25.280
The husband seems to be living it up in the flower district too.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:25.280
[Note: "Flower district" is a euphemism for the red-light district.]

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.530
There's no doubt.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.030
Yes... but I feel...

00:06:31.450 --> 00:06:36.280
You're right, it's odd that they're spending money so carelessly.

00:06:36.830 --> 00:06:41.790
The cost of purchasing saltworks is too great to believe they're relying only on the profit from salt.

00:06:42.660 --> 00:06:45.550
A recent case where a large sum of money went missing...

00:06:48.510 --> 00:06:49.540
It can't be!

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.420
Nonetheless...

00:06:51.930 --> 00:06:58.060
So long as we make a report based on this evidence, you can definitely avoid dismissal.

00:06:58.060 --> 00:07:00.520
Y-Yes, you're right.

00:07:42.100 --> 00:07:44.600
I-It's... over...

00:07:46.600 --> 00:07:49.730
Shuurei-san, how are you getting on?

00:07:49.730 --> 00:07:52.260
Oh, am I bothering you?

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:57.280
No, it's all right. I've just finished.

00:07:57.820 --> 00:07:59.890
A-Are you okay?

00:07:59.890 --> 00:08:02.540
Don't tell me you didn't sleep last night.

00:08:02.540 --> 00:08:03.790
I didn't.

00:08:04.430 --> 00:08:05.920
But I'm fine.

00:08:06.810 --> 00:08:09.510
There's somewhere I want to go now.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:10.350
What?

00:08:10.350 --> 00:08:11.710
You won't make it.

00:08:11.710 --> 00:08:13.920
Why don't you get some sleep first?

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:16.050
All you need to do now is to read it through, right?

00:08:16.050 --> 00:08:18.500
Besides, the deadline is tomorrow.

00:08:18.500 --> 00:08:20.100
Yes, but...

00:08:23.220 --> 00:08:24.190
Here.

00:08:24.190 --> 00:08:28.350
I'll wake you up later, so get some sleep.

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:34.450
Thank you. Will you wake me in the late afternoon?

00:08:34.450 --> 00:08:38.220
Yes, I understand. In the late afternoon.

00:08:39.700 --> 00:08:41.000
Please.

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:42.790
Yes.

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:04.470
Oh, did I wake you up?

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:06.580
I'm sorry.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:08.580
Where's Seiga-san?

00:09:08.580 --> 00:09:12.570
He said that he had business to attend to and left.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.070
Oh!

00:09:18.390 --> 00:09:20.700
I'd better go as well!

00:09:20.700 --> 00:09:23.950
Now? It's dark already, so be careful.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:27.100
The report!

00:09:27.620 --> 00:09:30.160
Do you know what happened to the contents of this box?!

00:09:30.160 --> 00:09:31.410
No...

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:53.080
Who... took it?

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:01.070
Halt, halt.

00:10:01.480 --> 00:10:02.750
What's wrong?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:05.240
Something happened there, apparently.

00:10:13.900 --> 00:10:15.000
Why?

00:10:20.670 --> 00:10:24.620
The report and the evidence haven't been submitted, yet...

00:10:24.620 --> 00:10:26.560
Hey, I thought you'd come.

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:27.480
Oh,

00:10:27.480 --> 00:10:28.930
Seiga-san!

00:10:30.950 --> 00:10:34.400
You're hopelessly soft-hearted, aren't you?

00:10:34.770 --> 00:10:36.690
Seiga-san...

00:10:37.260 --> 00:10:41.300
When you said you needed to go somewhere, I thought, "It's not possible,"

00:10:41.300 --> 00:10:44.330
but I'm glad I took action beforehand.

00:10:44.750 --> 00:10:45.820
You...

00:10:45.820 --> 00:10:47.750
I'll tell you one thing.

00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:50.370
Namely, who owns this residence.

00:10:50.370 --> 00:10:52.330
This is the Chin family's...

00:10:53.680 --> 00:10:55.840
Not only that.

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.720
The mistress of this residence is that raccoon's real mother.

00:10:59.720 --> 00:11:02.130
What? This is Tan-tan's...

00:11:02.130 --> 00:11:05.490
Yeah, she remarried into this family.

00:11:06.240 --> 00:11:07.720
No...

00:11:08.640 --> 00:11:11.940
Inspector Riku, all the suspects have been caught.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.110
The only ones left are the mistress and her servant.

00:11:14.420 --> 00:11:18.490
Leave the woman. Take all the valuables.

00:11:18.490 --> 00:11:19.110
Yes, sir!

00:11:19.850 --> 00:11:22.240
An undercover... inspector...

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:28.300
Honestly, the last month has been nothing but a pain.

00:11:28.300 --> 00:11:33.150
If you'd interfered again, you'd have ruined my reputation.

00:11:33.150 --> 00:11:37.750
I thought I was going to explode in anger with you over the forgery and counterfeiting case.

00:11:38.070 --> 00:11:39.510
The forgery and counterfeiting case too?

00:11:39.750 --> 00:11:45.860
I was working on it carefully, so I could round them up, but you!

00:11:46.420 --> 00:11:49.290
You dashed around, attracting so much attention!

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:51.420
Are you an idiot?!

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.090
Then...

00:11:54.850 --> 00:11:56.580
you took the report!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:02.200
Seriously, you're useless.

00:12:02.200 --> 00:12:06.950
Leaving valuables where anyone can take them, and sleeping peacefully!

00:12:07.270 --> 00:12:11.100
I submitted the report and the evidence ages ago.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:12.980
You're through.

00:12:13.430 --> 00:12:15.960
I don't think so.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.370
Tan-tan!

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.400
Why are you here?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:24.550
Hey, didn't you say that this was my mother's residence, Seiga?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.970
What's so surprising about me visiting the place regularly?

00:12:27.710 --> 00:12:32.120
To tell you the truth, I only started working here recently.

00:12:32.120 --> 00:12:35.930
Oh, by the way, my mother completely failed to recognize me.

00:12:35.930 --> 00:12:38.110
She doesn't seem to remember my face at all.

00:12:40.520 --> 00:12:43.600
So you've finally shown your true self?

00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:48.120
It was suspicious enough to find you in the joukan's room to start with.

00:12:48.850 --> 00:12:50.070
Don't bluff!

00:12:50.070 --> 00:12:53.590
There's no way you could've known about me!

00:12:53.590 --> 00:12:55.980
I'd heard rumors about you.

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:59.260
That you were the youngest undercover inspector ever appointed.

00:13:00.100 --> 00:13:02.380
I didn't recognize you at first,

00:13:02.380 --> 00:13:09.010
but you used my real name even though oujo-san had only called me "Tan-tan."

00:13:09.330 --> 00:13:12.520
You're better than I thought, Suou-san.

00:13:17.020 --> 00:13:19.860
Hey, do you regret dropping your guard?

00:13:19.860 --> 00:13:23.470
Because you thought I was just an idiot?

00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:26.320
You knew about it.

00:13:26.320 --> 00:13:27.570
Then why?

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:32.010
Well, I thought you'd get your work done more quickly with him.

00:13:32.010 --> 00:13:33.580
That's true...

00:13:36.190 --> 00:13:38.270
You fooled me into this?

00:13:38.800 --> 00:13:43.530
Huh? No. I just thought it was better this way.

00:13:43.530 --> 00:13:45.880
I didn't think much about it.

00:13:46.840 --> 00:13:49.060
Whatever, it's all over now.

00:13:49.060 --> 00:13:51.070
No matter what you do now...

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:55.740
Like I said, oujo-san won't be dismissed.

00:13:55.740 --> 00:13:57.020
What do you mean by that?

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:04.780
Remember the actual seal that was used to counterfeit money?

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:06.950
The ones at my father's house were all trials.

00:14:07.350 --> 00:14:08.820
That's right...

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:12.830
We never found the seal that was actually used for counterfeiting.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.680
That's why I've been looking for it all this time.

00:14:15.680 --> 00:14:19.330
If I found the seal, then it would prove that the true culprit was someone else,

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:21.840
and my dad's death sentence would be lifted.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:26.040
And I found it in this residence.

00:14:27.050 --> 00:14:29.550
How did you know it was here?

00:14:29.810 --> 00:14:36.450
My dad was in a great mood from when he told me to marry Kou Shuurei until he got caught.

00:14:36.450 --> 00:14:41.590
So I thought, this might have something to do with my mother.

00:14:41.590 --> 00:14:43.570
What? That means...

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:49.570
The counterfeiting, forgeries, and salt... were all connected?

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.080
My mother hated my dad when she left,

00:14:53.080 --> 00:14:55.650
but it seems my dad still adores my mother.

00:14:55.650 --> 00:15:00.980
So Chin, my mother's current husband, took advantage of Dad's weakness.

00:15:01.890 --> 00:15:05.710
Chin encouraged my dad by telling him that my mother would be happy if he brought artworks.

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:08.560
But... But that's...

00:15:08.560 --> 00:15:10.140
...too much of a coincidence.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:14.720
Someone plotted all these incidents.

00:15:15.030 --> 00:15:19.730
Like that raccoon's father, the Chin family's been used too!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:22.230
Whoever is behind it must be very influential.

00:15:22.230 --> 00:15:25.230
If we get involved any deeper, we'll be risking our lives.

00:15:25.230 --> 00:15:27.880
Yeah, probably.

00:15:27.880 --> 00:15:31.660
It seems like Dad never met that person either.

00:15:31.660 --> 00:15:34.530
So he doesn't know who it was?

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:35.690
Apparently not.

00:15:35.690 --> 00:15:38.810
So I made a bargain with a higher official.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:44.200
I'd go find solid evidence, in return for my dad's life.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:46.820
Even so, how did you...

00:15:46.820 --> 00:15:48.550
It wasn't easy.

00:15:48.830 --> 00:15:51.300
Anyway, you should keep that.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.190
That will keep you from being dismissed, won't it?

00:15:54.190 --> 00:15:57.040
You'd employ her, wouldn't you, Director General?!

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.130
Here comes the Director General of the Section of Government Inspection.

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:16.910
What?

00:16:22.890 --> 00:16:26.920
So you were a soft-hearted fool
through and through, Kou Shuurei.

00:16:27.410 --> 00:16:29.010
You're utterly useless!

00:16:29.870 --> 00:16:30.920
However,

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:34.210
you have a quick mind, probably as good as Seiga's.

00:16:34.930 --> 00:16:38.760
Also, your connections have some value.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:41.960
Only, you're worthless on your own.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:45.830
Shin Suou, if you'll come as well, then I'll consider it.

00:16:47.400 --> 00:16:51.440
You have no talent, but that's a talent in itself.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:54.820
It's hard for Seiga to play the fool,

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:57.870
but since you're a fool to begin with,
your opponents lower their guard.

00:16:57.870 --> 00:17:00.150
If you have the will to work, then come.

00:17:00.150 --> 00:17:02.290
I'll take full advantage of you.

00:17:02.760 --> 00:17:05.740
I don't feel like I'm being praised at all.

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:10.740
Don't expect that you'll get away with your soft-hearted foolishness in my section.

00:17:10.740 --> 00:17:14.050
If you're prepared to do anything, then come.

00:17:14.050 --> 00:17:17.460
Until you reach a high enough official rank, forget about your ideals.

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.390
Don't even mention justice.

00:17:19.390 --> 00:17:22.060
If you don't rise at the expense of your colleague, your colleague will.

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:25.810
When you fall, you'll learn that your existence had no significance.

00:17:37.220 --> 00:17:40.320
Who would've thought that the Director General would choose you?

00:17:40.560 --> 00:17:43.840
Well, if you do join, I'll smash you to pieces.

00:17:46.830 --> 00:17:50.040
I... really was soft-hearted, wasn't I?

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:54.370
Well, yeah, I can't deny that.

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:57.310
Tan-tan, you told me that many times.

00:17:57.310 --> 00:18:03.850
Hey, I only decided to do this because you stuck to your beliefs.

00:18:03.850 --> 00:18:04.880
What?

00:18:04.880 --> 00:18:06.100
You're soft-hearted,

00:18:06.560 --> 00:18:08.650
but I said I didn't dislike it, remember?

00:18:08.650 --> 00:18:12.610
I won't be able to breathe if the Imperial Court fills up with guys like Seiga.

00:18:15.610 --> 00:18:16.830
I'm going there.

00:18:16.830 --> 00:18:20.130
What? So quick? You're not gonna give it a second thought-

00:18:20.130 --> 00:18:21.040
What about you, Tan-tan?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:24.490
Well, I've got to work.

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:26.120
Then we're going.

00:18:26.120 --> 00:18:30.250
If that's the only way to remain as an official, then there's no point thinking about it.

00:18:30.250 --> 00:18:33.380
I'll never be like Seiga!

00:18:33.860 --> 00:18:36.320
I won't let Seiga knock me down.

00:18:39.870 --> 00:18:43.390
What? Your father hasn't passed away?

00:18:43.390 --> 00:18:45.320
He's not dead.

00:18:45.320 --> 00:18:47.270
He's alive and well.

00:18:48.350 --> 00:18:51.430
To tell you the truth, he was nearly assassinated.

00:18:51.430 --> 00:18:54.670
Someone sent poisoned food to my dad in my name.

00:18:57.080 --> 00:19:01.160
Usually, I bring him a rice ball wrapped in bamboo leaf, so he got suspicious.

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.760
A rice ball...

00:19:02.760 --> 00:19:05.350
So I made a deal with the Director General,

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:10.040
got Dad out of prison, and faked his death.

00:19:10.040 --> 00:19:11.670
Was that so?

00:19:12.030 --> 00:19:15.420
I asked your bamboo shoot family retainer to guard him.

00:19:15.420 --> 00:19:17.820
What?! Seiran?!

00:19:17.820 --> 00:19:18.960
I didn't know.

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:22.860
Anyway, in the end, who was behind all this?

00:19:22.860 --> 00:19:24.490
It's unforgivable.

00:19:25.030 --> 00:19:26.140
True...

00:19:28.020 --> 00:19:30.140
What was his objective?

00:19:41.140 --> 00:19:45.160
I'm glad we could stop it at an early stage.

00:19:45.160 --> 00:19:48.770
If it had caused any greater problems, we would've had no other choice

00:19:48.770 --> 00:19:53.290
but to establish an office to monitor and control not just salt, but tea and iron too.

00:19:53.560 --> 00:19:56.860
Yes, that was probably their true objective.

00:19:56.860 --> 00:20:03.050
If you appoint a subordinate to an independent office with enormous power and influence, then...

00:20:04.220 --> 00:20:07.180
As expected of Yuushun-dono, you have keen insight.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:10.610
No, this was just a skirmish.

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:15.440
The money earned from the counterfeiting, forgeries, and salt hasn't been found yet.

00:20:18.070 --> 00:20:19.790
Youshin,

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:25.080
you say my sweet niece is "too soft-hearted, too dreamy, too careless, and too trusting.

00:20:25.080 --> 00:20:28.830
Riku Seiga snatched all the credit from her, etc, etc."

00:20:28.830 --> 00:20:32.080
How dare you write all this?

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.790
It's all true.

00:20:33.790 --> 00:20:37.940
And what's this at the end? "But I'd let her be my wife."

00:20:37.940 --> 00:20:40.910
I'm concerned that she's starting to get too old to be marriageable.

00:20:40.910 --> 00:20:43.260
Besides, she's better suited to being a housewife than a government official-

00:20:43.260 --> 00:20:44.930
Cut the crap, you idiot!

00:20:45.290 --> 00:20:47.470
Who'd give her to you as your wife?!

00:20:47.810 --> 00:20:50.470
Th-There's no need to take it so seriously...

00:20:50.470 --> 00:20:54.990
I-In any case, if she's joining the Section of Government Inspection, she won't be soft-hearted for long.

00:20:57.060 --> 00:21:00.610
The assessments are in from all the undercover officials.

00:21:05.410 --> 00:21:06.600
We will begin.

00:21:06.600 --> 00:21:07.870
Time for a general cleaning.

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.870
Get rid of them all!

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:14.910
In summary, the assessment,

00:21:14.910 --> 00:21:18.420
including upper class and middle class nobles, every department and position,

00:21:18.420 --> 00:21:20.920
has been carried out.

00:21:20.920 --> 00:21:23.890
A list of names to be dismissed has been created accordingly.

00:21:23.890 --> 00:21:24.920
That is my report.

00:21:25.780 --> 00:21:28.120
It was supposed to include only lower class nobles!

00:21:28.120 --> 00:21:29.070
But all officials?

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:32.040
Prime Minister Tei's gotten the upper hand, hasn't he?

00:21:34.560 --> 00:21:40.550
About the other issue that Ou Ki raised along with dismissal of the joukan, namely,

00:21:41.030 --> 00:21:47.110
the proposal to establish a designated office for controlling and monitoring tea, iron, and salt,

00:21:47.110 --> 00:21:52.080
that is, the country's important products, will be postponed for now.

00:21:52.720 --> 00:21:55.770
The matter will be handled by the Ministry of Finance,

00:21:55.770 --> 00:21:58.430
I have heard from Minister Kou of the Ministry of Finance himself.

00:22:05.010 --> 00:22:07.670
If there are no other proposals, then...

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:09.760
Please hold on a moment!

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:10.970
Oh, no!

00:22:10.970 --> 00:22:14.970
I have an announcement to make!

00:22:17.830 --> 00:22:20.680
For many years, the Secretary's post in the
Department of Mystic Study has been vacant,

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:22.980
but I have invited a new Chief Secretary to fill the position!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:25.760
Please welcome Hyou Riou-dono!

00:22:33.710 --> 00:22:34.990
A child?!

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:38.010
By tradition, this position is only given to a member of the Hyou family, but...

00:22:38.010 --> 00:22:39.800
Seriously...

00:22:48.040 --> 00:22:48.990
Yeah!

00:22:48.990 --> 00:22:50.410
Yay!

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:52.040
Thanks, officer Kou!

00:22:52.040 --> 00:22:54.620
I'm really happy!

00:23:21.440 --> 00:23:23.960
"We'll send Jyuusan-hime over."

00:23:24.830 --> 00:23:27.190
"Get her into the Imperial Residence"?

00:24:44.960 --> 00:24:48.980
Since I got sacked as Sashuu governor and came back to Kiyou,

00:24:48.980 --> 00:24:51.330
a lot has happened, hasn't it?

00:24:51.330 --> 00:24:53.470
Anyway, life is good as long as you're busy, right?

00:24:54.230 --> 00:24:57.120
Oh, Seiran? What are you doing with those bamboo shoots?
